The '''Aklex''' are a pair of {{Weapon|Lex}} pistols. Compared to a single Lex, the Aklex have a higher rate of fire and magazine size. However, they have no polarity slot, lower accuracy, and a slower reload speed.

This weapon can be sold for ‍'''5,000'''.

==Characteristics==
*This weapon deals primarily {{D|Puncture}} damage.

{{Advantages|
*Very good ammunition efficiency.
}}

{{Disadvantages|}}

{{WeaponComparison|Lex}}
{{WeaponComparison|Aklex Prime|header=n}}

==Acquisition==
The Aklex's blueprint can be purchased from the [[Market]].

{{BuildAutomatic|type=Weapon}}

==Notes==
*Despite the description of the Aklex saying that its reload time suffers, its actual reload time is quite efficient, spanning a mere 1.27 times its original reload duration, as most akimbo pistols have twice the reload time.
*Despite the accuracy mentioned in its statistics is poor, its actual accuracy is quite impressive, even when against long-ranged targets, leaving only the recoil to be held responsible for this.

==Tips==
*A {{M|Stunning Speed}} mod synergizes well with this weapon, reducing its long reload and increasing its high [[status chance]] further (although not by much).
*{{M|Steady Hands}} makes the Aklex's high [[recoil]] much easier to control and allow for more accurate shots on the target in a shorter span of time without having to readjust after shots as often.

==Trivia==
*The Aklex and its [[Aklex Prime|Prime]] and [[Lex|singular]] variants share similar weapon sounds to the [https://darksector.fandom.com/wiki/Hammer_1895 Hammer 1895], a revolver featured in Dark Sector.

