{{BuildAutomatic|type=Weapon}}

==Tips==
*To shorten the reload time of 2.4 seconds, equipping {{M|Quickdraw}}/{{M|Primed Quickdraw}} may be preferred, or {{M|Stunning Speed}} to benefit both the reload time and status chance.
