The '''Akstiletto''' are a pair of machine pistols designed by the {{Faction|Tenno}}, featuring a high rate of fire, a very fast reload time and good accuracy.

This weapon can be sold for {{cc|2,500}}. It is also a [[weapon crafting ingredient]] for {{Weapon|Aksomati}} and the {{Weapon|Sarpa}}.
{{Checklist|nocategory=true|
